{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q031","title":"第31題","version":"3","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"83caeb074a3001d989dad1f13efa1c9a0111d9ae6ec906987e0b1d1292790a52","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_e9d27be527fc81919b299e5c3b42557c","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q031","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>跗骨隧道位於內踝後方，通過內容物可用 Tom, Dick, And Very Nervous Harry 記：tibialis posterior、flexor digitorum longus、posterior tibial artery/vein、tibial nerve、flexor hallucis longus。脛前肌腱走在踝前方，不通過跗骨隧道。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第31題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>A</p></div><div><div><div><h3>閱讀詳解</h3><p><strong>答案是A，脛前肌。</strong>題目通常所指的跗骨隧道，在<strong>內踝後方</strong>，由屈肌支持帶覆蓋。脛後肌、屈趾長肌與屈踇長肌的肌腱都從內踝後方進入足部；脛前肌肌腱則跨過踝前方，走在伸肌支持帶下，因此不通過這條隧道。</p><p>名稱相似不代表路徑相同：脛前肌位在小腿前側，收縮使踝背屈，肌腱跨在踝關節轉動軸前方；脛後肌位在深後側，肌腱繞過內踝後方，協助蹠屈及足內翻。先辨前、後位置，就能快速排除脛前肌。</p><div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><caption>跗骨隧道由前向後的排列</caption><thead><tr><th>順序</th><th>構造</th><th>記憶詞</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>脛後肌腱</td><td>Tom：tibialis posterior</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>屈趾長肌腱</td><td>Dick：flexor digitorum longus</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>後脛動脈與伴行靜脈</td><td>And Very：artery、veins</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>脛神經</td><td>Nervous：nerve</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>拇趾長屈肌腱</td><td>Harry：flexor hallucis longus</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:922px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5680272108843538\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/33e5d45c180c96bbd5c5ddcc7d3e5f3f977382731fc91ea30757fd0ee3d66f13.png\" alt=\"內踝後方跗骨隧道內容物\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"922\" height=\"588\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/33e5d45c180c96bbd5c5ddcc7d3e5f3f977382731fc91ea30757fd0ee3d66f13.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption>內踝內側觀：紅色的屈肌支持帶覆蓋跗骨隧道，可見脛後肌、屈趾長肌、拇趾長屈肌肌腱以及後脛血管、脛神經。脛前肌不在這條內踝後方通道內。</figcaption></figure><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:260px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.26\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ceaeeaf61ce3e05ea4f0e01eee17cb9871ac4502b53898a05444abf33474f223.png\" alt=\"脛前肌腱的踝前方走行\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"260\" height=\"1000\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ceaeeaf61ce3e05ea4f0e01eee17cb9871ac4502b53898a05444abf33474f223.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption>小腿及足前方觀：脛前肌（tibialis anterior）肌腱向下通過踝前方的伸肌支持帶，再走向足內側。這張前方圖與上面的內踝後方圖對照，可直接看出脛前肌的不同路徑。</figcaption></figure></div></div><div><h3>逐項判讀</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd>正確。脛前肌腱走踝前方，不走內踝後方的跗骨隧道；由深腓神經支配，主要背屈踝及內翻足。</dd><dt>B</dt><dd>脛後肌腱是隧道中最前方的一條肌腱，繞內踝後方到足內側及足底。</dd><dt>C</dt><dd>屈踇長肌即拇趾長屈肌，肌腱通過跗骨隧道，位置在所列內容物的最後方，最後到拇趾遠端趾骨。</dd><dt>D</dt><dd>屈趾長肌腱位在脛後肌腱之後，通過隧道後向足底，負責第2–5趾屈曲。</dd></dl></div><div><h3>一起考：神經壓迫與肌腱路徑</h3><p>跗骨隧道症候群主要是此處<strong>脛神經</strong>受壓，常造成足底疼痛、麻木或感覺異常。脛前肌的深腓神經支配與踝前方走行，則屬另一組解剖線索。</p><p>不要把「肌肉支配神經」和「肌腱通過隧道」混成一件事：肌肉在小腿接受神經支配，肌腱把收縮力量傳到足部；跗管內則同時有肌腱、血管與神經。</p></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK513273/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Posterior Tarsal Tunnel Syndrome，解剖段落</a>：內踝後方內容物與排列</li><li><a href=\"https://rad.uw.edu/muscle-atlas/tibialis-anterior\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">University of Washington，Tibialis Anterior</a>：前側肌群、動作及支配</li><li><a href=\"https://rad.uw.edu/muscle-atlas/tibialis-posterior\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">University of Washington，Tibialis Posterior</a>：動作、止點及支配</li><li><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jmd2.12021\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Williams等，Tarsal tunnel syndrome in the mucopolysaccharidoses（2019）</a>：跗管示意圖</li><li>圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tarsal_tunnel.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tarsal tunnel.png</a>；Nicole Williams、Jake Willet、Damian Clark、David Ketteridge；Commons頁所載之改編圖；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>；保留原圖，另附中文圖說</li><li>圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray437.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray437.png</a>；Henry Vandyke Carter，Gray’s Anatomy（1918）；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">公有領域</a>；保留原圖，另附中文圖說</li></ul></details></div></div></div></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：A"}